('graphics_noun_0', 'graphics', 'noun', 0, 'Visual representations used to illustrate information in academic texts and presentations, including diagrams, charts, and images.', '["figures", "illustrations", "images"]', '["text", "nonvisual data"]', '["visual content"]', '["bar charts", "line graphs", "maps", "photographs"]', '["computer graphics", "graphics card", "graphics software", "vector graphics", "raster graphics", "graphic design"]', '{"noun_forms": ["graphic"], "verb_forms": ["graph"], "adjective_forms": ["graphic"], "adverb_forms": ["graphically"]}', '["The paper includes graphics illustrating the experimental results.", "Appendix A presents graphics used to summarize the data."]', 'technology', '3', 61615, 4777, NULL, 'opengloss-v1.1'),
